OL,3,GNEWSAProperty law plans to make buying
OL,4,Ahomes easier
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecuring a mortgage could become easier
OL,7,Fif proposed changes to Alderney's
OL,8,Fproperty laws are agreed.
OL,10,FThe States of Alderney is considering
OL,11,Ffour reforms designed to remove
OL,12,Fbarriers to mortgage lending and make
OL,13,Fit simpler to buy leasehold properties
OL,14,Fin the island.
OL,16,FThe draft Real Property (Reform)
OL,17,F(Alderney) Law 2026 outlines plans to
OL,18,Fmake it easier for flats and other
OL,19,Fparts of a building to be individually
OL,20,Fowned and a framework to manage lease
OL,21,Fbreaches.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
