OL,3,GNEWSAProperty law plans to make buying
OL,4,Ahomes easier
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlso proposed is the allowance of
OL,7,Fqualifying long leases to be used as
OL,8,Fmortgage security and permission for
OL,9,Fthe court to delay eviction proceedings
OL,10,Fif a lease may be lost because its
OL,11,Fconditions have been breached.
